    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000ttua](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000ttua) Magnitude 5.7 earthquake at 128.068 depth occurred on Oct 28 2026 276 km WSW of Tual, Indonesia. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -6.3958 longitude 130.3764. It impacted 357 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
